kestrel-self-destruct-bolted = The terminal is bolted down. To remove it: cut the bolts with a welder, then use a wrench and a crowbar.
kestrel-self-destruct-loose = The terminal isn't bolted down. Use a wrench to bolt it to the floor.
kestrel-construction-condition-nuke-not-armed = It can't be unbolted while it's armed.
